  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "After the writer Whitley Strieber put out Communion, his 1987 book about encounters with strange beings, nearly half a million people wrote letters to him and his wife. The Hollywood writer Bryce Zabel tells Michels this, passing on what he heard from Strieber. To Zabel it shows how many people felt they had lived something like what Strieber described."
